  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Local Climate Resillience in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the programme is to support Government efforts to reduce climate vulnerability through improving delivery of climate resilient basic services to the rural communities and enhancing the knowledge-based decision making in Nampula and Zambezia Provinces. It has two main outputs: 1)Implement the National Climate Change Monitoring System and 2) Reduce climate-induced vulnerability at the local-district level by supporting the implementation of concrete actions from the Local Adaptation Plans.</narrative>
  </description>
